  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Tensions Reduction in Lebanon through improved Enviromental Support and Solar Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Strengthened stabilization and green recovery to reduce vulnerabilities and environmental risks.
Output 1.1: Solutions scaled up for sustainable management of natural resources, including sustainable commodities and green and inclusive value chains.
Activity 1: Supporting municipalities &amp; partners on environmental approaches to reduce tensions
Sub-Activity 1.1. Greening of the LCRP Activities
Sub-Activity 1.2. Mainstreaming of Circular Economy Principles in Environmental Response
Sub-Activity 1.3. Supporting Municipalities in Addressing Environmental Challenges

Activity 2: Reducing tensions through renewable energy projects
Sub-Activity 2.1: Analysis of the Energy Sector on Tension
Sub-Activity 2.2: Implementation of Sustainable Energy Solutions</narrative>
  </description>
